3.5 Qdrant
Collection invoices_rag, cosine distance, size EMBED_DIM.

Payload:

{"invoice_id":"...","chunk_text":"...","source_type":"invoice|report","vendor":"...",
 "language":"fr|en|...","chunk_index":0,"invoice_number":"..."}
Keyword payload indexes on invoice_id, source_type, vendor, language.

Point ids are uuid5(NS, f"{invoice_id}:{source_type}:{language}:{chunk_index}"), so upserts are idempotent.

3.6 Redis (disposable)
Keys are translation:{sha256(source_text)}, lang:{sha256(first_1500_chars)} and llm:{sha256(model+messages+temperature)}, all with a TTL. Start Redis with --save "" --appendonly no and no volume. If Redis is flushed, the system only gets slower.

