Required fields: every field in rules.required_fields must be present, otherwise add it to missing_fields with a high-severity discrepancy.
Line totals: quantity × unit_price must equal line_total within line_total_tolerance_abs.
Subtotal: Σ line_total must equal subtotal if present.
Tax: expected_tax = subtotal × rate/100, with the rate taken from tax.rate_pct_by_currency or the default. Compare it to tax_amount within tax.tolerance_abs.
Total: subtotal + tax_amount must equal total_amount. If tax is absent, compare Σ line_total to total_amount.
